  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Strengthening for ESOs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This capacity strengthening program aims to enhance quality of incubation and acceleration programs provided by Burundian entrepreneurial support organizations (ESOs). At the end of this project, participating ESOs will be capable of developing or improving a comprehensive program that will provide future entrepreneurs with the necessary skills to start and grow their businesses. In this way, the project will establish lasting improvements in the quality of ESOs in Burundi, which is now below regional average.</narrative>
  </description>
